{"id":"vod_bf_35475","vodId":"35475","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"未来都市NO.6","name_cn":"未来都市NO.6","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-36/ed0d475da4d975c152dd982b8283837e.jpg"},"summary":"2013年，都市NO.6。这里是一个没有犯罪，没有疾病，没有战争，没有所谓痛苦和怨恨的理想国度。一直这么认为的12岁天才少年紫苑（梶裕贵 配音）和母亲住在NO.6的高级住宅区，在一个暴风雨的夜晚邂逅了颠覆他世界观的人——伤痕累累，有戾气的少年老鼠（细谷佳正 配音）。对老鼠感到好奇和好感的紫苑不但没有感到害怕还救了老鼠，结果被认为窝藏嫌疑犯，被剥夺了所有特权，继而沦为了公园管理员。　　经历了这场变故的紫苑对所生存的理想世界产生了怀疑，城市里也频繁发生恐怖的死人事件。而这些事件和NO.6有着千丝万缕的联系，愈发困惑的紫苑不知自己已处在生死边缘，在关键时刻，被四年不见的老鼠所救，来到了NO.6外圈的贫民区。在这里，紫苑逐渐认识到了NO.6的真相，而危险远没有离开他们……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 22:46:37","playable":true,"episodeCount":11,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/weilaidushiNO6/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/weilaidushiNO6/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/weilaidushiNO6/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/weilaidushiNO6/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/weilaidushiNO6/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/weilaidushiNO6/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/weilaidushiNO6/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/weilaidushiNO6/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/weilaidushiNO6/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/weilaidushiNO6/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/weilaidushiNO6/第11集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:36:01.564Z"}